{"about_the_game":"This is a survivors-like game set in the backdrop of the Three Kingdoms era.  Players will step into the shoes of renowned generals from that period, grow through each battle, unleash the power of their martial spirit, constantly take on stronger foes, and ultimately conquer the three kingdoms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/8ee842cd40bba1c981c6f31420660d56.poster.avif?t=1737724598\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/8ee842cd40bba1c981c6f31420660d56.webm?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/8ee842cd40bba1c981c6f31420660d56.mp4?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can choose from nearly 20 renowned generals from the Three Kingdoms, each with their own unique abilities.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/ae6f7b6ed2344a7d57a62e172756a2c2.poster.avif?t=1737724598\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/ae6f7b6ed2344a7d57a62e172756a2c2.webm?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/ae6f7b6ed2344a7d57a62e172756a2c2.mp4?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are dozens of distinctive weapons to choose from, along with a special weapon upgrade system. Even a basic sword can be transformed into a powerful divine weapon.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/8e587af3efea3d3cd7cc33b9ef83b370.poster.avif?t=1737724598\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/8e587af3efea3d3cd7cc33b9ef83b370.webm?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/8e587af3efea3d3cd7cc33b9ef83b370.mp4?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The battlefield is constantly changing, so try your best to dodge enemy attacks and carve a path through the opposing forces.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/6de0e8691299835f3846f2c4c653e3d4.poster.avif?t=1737724598\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/6de0e8691299835f3846f2c4c653e3d4.webm?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/6de0e8691299835f3846f2c4c653e3d4.mp4?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat enemies to gather resources, and use them to purchase weapons and equipment before the next wave of enemies arrives.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/c191e025087926a8e36ad0e4395d7a9b.poster.avif?t=1737724598\" width=598 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/c191e025087926a8e36ad0e4395d7a9b.webm?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/c191e025087926a8e36ad0e4395d7a9b.mp4?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a conquest across the Three Kingdoms, overcome various challenges, and ultimately conquer the land.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/1a507af78b55e2c965471d1e89505a71.poster.avif?t=1737724598\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/1a507af78b55e2c965471d1e89505a71.webm?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/1a507af78b55e2c965471d1e89505a71.mp4?t=1737724598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483670?t=1737724598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483670?t=1737724598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737724598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737724598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2802230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"This is a survivors-like game set in the backdrop of the Three Kingdoms era.  Players will step into the shoes of renowned generals from that period, grow through each battle, unleash the power of their martial spirit, constantly take on stronger foes, and ultimately conquer the three kingdoms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483670/extras/8ee842cd40bba1c981c6f31420660d56.poster.avif?t=17